ality\n- `test_cancelCancelsAllCreatedShipmentsForTheOrder` - Shipment cascading\n- `test_cancelIsIdempotentCancellingAnAlreadyCancelledOrderSucceeds` - Idempotency (retry safety)\n- `test_cancelFailsWithConflictIfOrderHasConfirmedShipmentsAndChangesNothing` - All-or-nothing + 409 response\n- `test_cancelReturns404ForNonExistentOrder` - 404 error handling\n- `test_rejectsShipmentCreationForCancelledOrderWith409` - Prevents shipments for cancelled orders\n- All existing tests continue to pass with new behavior\n\n**Verification:** `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/` - BUILD SUCCESS, 21 tests passed (10 OrderControllerTest, 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests, 7 ShipmentControllerTest, 3 CustomerControllerTest)\n\n**Not done:** Nothing. All acceptance criteria satisfied, all tests pass, no forbidden files modified, no new dependencies added."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3290,"cache_read_input_tokens":36268,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3290},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bcc63f47-3b1a-4865-89b4-56ea0b594873","uuid":"b3ad4f92-f6bd-456c-9875-1ca5322e5a8c","timestamp":"2026-09-30T16:27:40.881Z","request_id":"req_011CfZwNTAEQU6QzrvpNgDHH"}
