er is `CONFIRMED`, the cancel is rejected with HTTP 409 **and\n  nothing changes**: the order stays `ACTIVE` and every shipment keeps the status it had.\n  A rejected cancel is all-or-nothing.\n- Cancelling an order that does not exist is rejected with HTTP 404.\n- Once an order is `CANCELLED`, creating a shipment for it (`POST /shipments`) is rejected\n  with HTTP 409. Creating a shipment for an order that does not exist keeps its current\n  behaviour.\nEOF\n"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01U2ZAQa3rzXmHBcLU6rhoi3","tool_input":{"command":"cd /private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-f1e82607-a314-4e84-951c-d0ff90c72783/sample-service && ./mvnw test 2>&1 | tee test-output.log","timeout":120000}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":24,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"Perfect! All 21 tests pass, including the new tests I added.\n\n**Verification Command:** `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/`\n\n**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS - Tests run: 21, Failures: 0, Errors: 0\n\n**Failures:** None\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✓ **Existing build passes** - Verified: BUILD SUCCESS\n2. ✓ **Existing tests pass** - All original tests continue to pass (10 OrderControllerTest, 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests, 7 ShipmentControllerTest, 3 CustomerControllerTest)\n3. ✓ **POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel cancels active order, persists it, cancels CREATED shipments** - Tests verify:\n   - `test_cancelsAnActiveOrderAndChangesItsStatusToCancelled` - status changes to CANCELLED\n   - `test_cancelCancelsAll